  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): キャラウェイタイム",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AD%E3%83%A3%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A0",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 108591665,
      "text": "キャラウェイタイム は、タイムの一種。コルシカ島、サルデーニャ島、マヨルカ島に自生している。その名はキャラウェイに香りが似ていることに由来し、料理の他に庭に植える常緑植物としても使われている。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Thymus herba-barona",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thymus_herba-barona",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1377392828,
      "text": "Thymus herba-barona is a species of thyme native to Corsica. It is also sometimes known by the common name caraway thyme, as it has a strong scent similar to caraway, for which it can be used as a substitute in any recipe. It can be used in cuisine or as an evergreen ground cover plant for the garden."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Thymus herba-barona",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thymus_herba-barona",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 227688738,
      "text": "Thymus herba-barona, l'herba-barona ou thym de Corse, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Lamiacées et appartenant au genre Thymus. C'est un sous-arbrisseau originaire de Corse."
    }
  },
